    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "Who said it?",
          "zh": "谁说它？",
          "startMs": 92970,
          "endMs": 94514
        },
        {
          "en": "To help the child understand who was speaking in the story.",
          "zh": "到帮助这孩子理解谁是说在……里这故事。",
          "startMs": 94514,
          "endMs": 102104
        },
        {
          "en": "• Ask the child how we know when someone starts to speak in a story.",
          "zh": "• 问这孩子如何我们知道当……时某人开始到说在……里一个故事。",
          "startMs": 102104,
          "endMs": 110853
        },
        {
          "en": "Can he/she find a page with speech marks?",
          "zh": "能他/她找到一个页和……一起说话能力斑点？",
          "startMs": 110853,
          "endMs": 116128
        },
        {
          "en": "• Choose any page where someone speaks.",
          "zh": "• 选择任何页哪里某人说。",
          "startMs": 116128,
          "endMs": 121145
        },
        {
          "en": "Ask the child who said it.",
          "zh": "问这孩子谁说它。",
          "startMs": 121145,
          "endMs": 124490
        },
        {
          "en": "• The child then reads something someone said and you have to find the page and say who said it.",
          "zh": "• 这孩子然后读某物某人说和你有到找到这页和说谁说它。",
          "startMs": 124490,
          "endMs": 136841
        },
        {
          "en": "• Have two or three turns each.",
          "zh": "• 有二或者三转动每个。",
          "startMs": 136841,
          "endMs": 140829
        },
        {
          "en": "You can use these ideas straight away, or on another day.",
          "zh": "你能使用这些主意直的离开， 或者在……上另一个一天。",
          "startMs": 140829,
          "endMs": 148162
        },
        {
          "en": "• Look through the book and find words with three letters.",
          "zh": "• 看穿过这书和找到单词和……一起三信。",
          "startMs": 148162,
          "endMs": 155624
        },
        {
          "en": "Ask the child if he/she can spell 'and\", 'the', 'dad', 'had\" , etc.",
          "zh": "问这孩子如果他/她能咒语 '和， '这'， '爸爸'， '有， etc。",
          "startMs": 155624,
          "endMs": 164244
        },
        {
          "en": "Give praise for correct spelling.",
          "zh": "给称赞为了正确的拼写。",
          "startMs": 164244,
          "endMs": 168490
        },
        {
          "en": "If possible, teach the child to skip.",
          "zh": "如果能做到的， 教这孩子到蹦蹦跳跳地走。",
          "startMs": 168490,
          "endMs": 173250
        }
      ],
